The fresh LLVM build exposed an error in my reviewer smoke case, not in the candidate: I had incorrectly asserted that `[-4, -3, -2]` is entirely below `-2`, overlooking the equality boundary. The semantics correctly raised `AssertionError`. I’m correcting that reviewer-authored test and will rerun it; the proof reconstruction is continuing independently.
