The inventory generator found all 764 fixed semantic rules, but its first report split guarded rules at indented `requires` clauses and its used-rule search had an escaping error. Those are evidence-script defects, so I’m tightening the parser to recognize only module-level starts and regenerating the exhaustive inventory before relying on its classifications.
