+| Partition | List and threshold | Claimed result | Submitted Python | Canonical |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| Empty | `[], 0` | `True` | `True` | `True` |
+| Int head | `[1, 3], 3` | `False` | `False` | `False` |
+| Bool head | `[False, True], 1` | `False` | `False` | `False` |
